<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/141.0.0.0 Safari/537.36" version="28.2.7">
  <diagram name="페이지-1" id="k7f859c8MbgdsD13ZR9u">
    <mxGraphModel dx="857" dy="435" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="owXG-dHpu00XaXQL31pa-1" value="Auth 내용 정리" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="40" width="120" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="owXG-dHpu00XaXQL31pa-3" value="인증서 chain은 세 개로 구성되어 있음&lt;div&gt;1. root certificate : WPC Root Certificate Authority를 증명, WPC가 sign, 인증서 자체가 아니라 인증서의 hash를 포함&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. CA certificate: product&#39;s manufacturer을 증명, WPC가 sign&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Product unit certificate : individual product를 증명, Manufactor Certificate Authority가 sign,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;CA certificate은 public key를 포함해서 product unit certificate를 증명&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;certificate에 적용되는 requirements&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- PUC는 rsid번호를 사용해서 고유한 전력 송신기, 수신기 제품을 식별 (wpc-ki-rsid)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- PUC는 특정 OID를 사용해서 RX&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;(wpc-ki-rsid-prx)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;인지 TX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;(wpc-ki-rsid-ptx)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;인지 확인&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- 각각의 Tx와 Rx는 고유의 public key를 가지고 있어야 함&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="50" width="690" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
